Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): guard branch writers and PR reviewers

Use shared claim and PR comments before dispatch and push. Keep claim lifetimes and the local review lock. Require compile checks before refresh pushes. Pin the cooperative procedure without claiming atomic exclusion.

Fixes #3661
